WEBVTT

01:21.331 --> 01:23.333
BASED ON THE KINGDOM OF THE GODS BY YLAB

02:45.039 --> 02:46.416
You mean to say...

02:46.499 --> 02:48.126
3 YEARS AGO

02:49.294 --> 02:51.337
...that this plant can resurrect the dead?

02:51.421 --> 02:52.255
That is correct.

02:52.964 --> 02:55.133
They will not die
even if you try to slice or stab them.

02:55.258 --> 02:57.385
They turn into monsters
with an undying thirst...

02:57.969 --> 02:59.637
for human flesh and blood.

03:00.221 --> 03:02.515
That's impossible.
How could the dead possibly--

03:02.599 --> 03:03.808
It is true.

03:05.143 --> 03:06.144
So?

03:07.103 --> 03:09.397
Why are you showing me this plant?

03:09.856 --> 03:11.941
Are you suggesting
we resurrect our dead soldiers

03:12.025 --> 03:14.819
so that they can fight
the Japanese invaders?

03:15.028 --> 03:15.862
No.

03:16.696 --> 03:18.907
Corpses that have already started to rot

03:19.199 --> 03:20.491
cannot be resurrected.

03:21.326 --> 03:25.580
And we cannot kill our soldiers
just to turn them into monsters.

03:26.164 --> 03:28.458
We should not squander
our military manpower like that.

03:34.672 --> 03:37.717
Then what on earth are you trying to say?

03:38.927 --> 03:40.845
The diseased people in Sumang Village.

03:43.598 --> 03:45.016
Let us kill them.

03:47.477 --> 03:49.312
If we turn them into monsters...

03:50.271 --> 03:52.690
and make them fight
against the Japanese army,

03:54.275 --> 03:56.361
we'll be able to survive this crisis.

03:59.405 --> 04:01.783
Are you serious about this?

04:01.866 --> 04:03.534
They will be considered useless...

04:04.369 --> 04:05.787
no matter where they go, anyway.

04:06.788 --> 04:09.582
We are willing to endure bloodshed
to fight off the Japanese,

04:10.166 --> 04:12.710
so that we could protect
our land and people.

04:13.878 --> 04:15.046
But this?

04:16.714 --> 04:18.591
Now you're suggesting...

04:19.175 --> 04:21.135
that we kill our people
with our own hands?

04:23.596 --> 04:25.265
We cannot do that.

04:28.810 --> 04:30.645
Bring the dead back to life?

04:30.728 --> 04:32.146
I cannot believe...

04:33.481 --> 04:34.816
such nonsense, either.

04:36.401 --> 04:37.944
Have you been fighting...

04:38.695 --> 04:41.197
for the lowly commoners?

04:48.329 --> 04:50.081
That is not why I've been fighting.

04:50.581 --> 04:52.375
What I have been trying to protect...

04:53.042 --> 04:56.254
are the royal family, the backbone
of this country, and their traditions.

04:57.255 --> 04:58.631
In order to do so,

04:59.549 --> 05:01.634
I will do just about anything.

05:26.284 --> 05:28.953
Soon, countless Japanese soldiers
will flock here.

05:29.037 --> 05:32.665
However, we only have
about 500 soldiers left.

05:33.333 --> 05:37.337
So how long do you insist on putting
benevolence and righteousness first?

05:38.671 --> 05:39.714
Lord Ahn.

05:43.885 --> 05:44.969
Consider...

05:45.720 --> 05:48.097
the countless people in Sangju.

05:49.891 --> 05:51.434
This is but a small sacrifice...

05:52.602 --> 05:54.520
necessary to save those people.

05:56.773 --> 05:58.191
All will be fine...

05:59.525 --> 06:00.943
if just the two of us...

06:01.694 --> 06:03.821
turn a blind eye to it.

06:10.620 --> 06:13.831
SUMANG VILLAGE

07:27.655 --> 07:30.366
The Japanese army
will invade our land soon.

07:30.867 --> 07:33.327
Close the gate facing Sangju.

07:33.953 --> 07:35.788
Open the one on the opposite side...

07:36.414 --> 07:37.748
facing the canal.

08:56.077 --> 08:59.455
I will not forget your sacrifice.

09:00.164 --> 09:03.709
And one day, I will pay back my debt.

09:54.135 --> 09:56.178
To stop the creatures
that rose from the dead,

09:56.762 --> 09:58.639
you must aim for their head.

10:02.810 --> 10:04.145
I do not believe this.

10:04.520 --> 10:05.896
How is this possible?

10:07.815 --> 10:10.860
Lord Ahn Hyeon definitely passed away.

10:10.943 --> 10:12.111
That is correct.

10:13.946 --> 10:16.073
Just as all of you had witnessed,

10:16.699 --> 10:18.618
he had indeed passed away.

10:22.204 --> 10:24.832
But that female physician resurrected him,

10:26.751 --> 10:29.837
just like how Cho Hak-ju
brought my father back from the dead.

10:32.340 --> 10:33.341
Now, tell us...

10:34.800 --> 10:36.761
everything you saw and heard.

10:43.726 --> 10:47.188
Lee Seung-hui,
the physician who taught me,

10:47.813 --> 10:50.483
recorded everything
in his patient journal.

10:57.698 --> 10:59.450
This plant is called
the resurrection plant.

11:00.034 --> 11:02.370
He used it to bring His Majesty
back from the dead,

11:02.703 --> 11:06.248
and that's why this plague
broke out in Gyeongsang.

11:12.171 --> 11:14.799
This is Father's patient journal,
which she just mentioned.

11:16.550 --> 11:20.012
He tried to disclose the truth.

11:21.972 --> 11:23.641
The Haewon Cho Clan...

11:25.142 --> 11:26.977
and their leader, Cho Hak-ju,

11:27.311 --> 11:29.021
are accusing me of plotting treason.

11:29.689 --> 11:32.191
However, what I want is not the throne.

11:34.318 --> 11:36.278
What I truly want...

11:37.738 --> 11:40.116
is to punish the Haewon Cho Clan...

11:41.409 --> 11:42.660
for degrading our nation.

11:48.499 --> 11:50.793
The Haewon Cho Clan
is guilty of mortal sin.

11:50.876 --> 11:53.003
They have treated
the corpse of the late king...

11:53.963 --> 11:56.924
with abominable disrespect
just so that they could keep their power.

11:57.550 --> 12:00.428
They oppressed the commoners,
who were ravaged by the war.

12:01.137 --> 12:02.930
And they deliberately starved them...

12:04.181 --> 12:06.058
by taking away their food.

12:06.142 --> 12:08.310
The Haewon Cho Clan's greed...

12:09.145 --> 12:11.564
caused this atrocious plague.

12:12.356 --> 12:14.692
Now, open your eyes and ears!

12:17.445 --> 12:19.071
Listen to the people...

12:20.114 --> 12:22.283
and heed the reality of this country.

12:24.702 --> 12:26.454
It is now time...

12:28.539 --> 12:30.499
to decide what the right thing is to do.

12:42.720 --> 12:44.513
Will you join me?

12:52.271 --> 12:56.358
THE CITADEL OF SANGJU

13:18.964 --> 13:21.175
The people inside the citadel

13:21.258 --> 13:23.219
will not be able
to hold out for much longer.

13:25.262 --> 13:27.181
We must get some food there
as soon as we can.

13:27.264 --> 13:29.517
Even the most skilled soldiers we have

13:29.642 --> 13:31.393
cannot ward them all off.

13:31.477 --> 13:33.270
They greatly outnumber us.

13:36.857 --> 13:38.776
We escaped through this canal.

13:39.193 --> 13:41.612
If we fill wagons with food
and take this route,

13:42.112 --> 13:43.489
it may work.

13:44.031 --> 13:46.158
We are the ones most familiar
with the area.

13:46.242 --> 13:47.368
We shall go.

13:48.619 --> 13:50.538
Our families are still inside the citadel.

13:50.621 --> 13:51.872
Please allow us to do it.

13:51.956 --> 13:53.415
You will be completely vulnerable.

13:54.291 --> 13:55.292
Will you be able to do it?

13:58.754 --> 13:59.880
We will take...

14:00.923 --> 14:02.216
this route.

14:02.550 --> 14:04.218
If you can cover us along the way...

14:08.264 --> 14:09.640
we may be able to do this.

14:09.723 --> 14:12.268
You will be visible
just after you cross the river,

14:12.351 --> 14:14.520
but you will soon enter the mountains.

14:15.479 --> 14:18.274
How can we cover you when we cannot
even see how far you have gone?

14:31.662 --> 14:32.538
Fire.

14:32.955 --> 14:34.081
Fire!

14:58.480 --> 15:01.108
FIRE

15:24.214 --> 15:25.466
Near the canal.

15:25.925 --> 15:27.968
They are launching bombs near the canal.

15:37.895 --> 15:39.730
Make haste, everyone!

15:40.105 --> 15:41.398
Make haste! Quickly, now!

15:43.067 --> 15:44.902
We have arrived.

15:49.198 --> 15:51.033
- They're here.
- We're saved!

15:51.116 --> 15:53.035
- Thank you!
- Thank you for saving us.

15:54.411 --> 15:56.705
Goodness, what is going on?

15:56.789 --> 15:59.959
His Royal Highness has managed
to take down Lord Cho Hak-ju

16:00.042 --> 16:01.710
and has taken control of Mungyeong Saejae.

16:01.794 --> 16:02.878
Is that right?

16:05.214 --> 16:07.424
He could not come with us

16:07.591 --> 16:09.551
for he must head to Hanyang
to resolve this matter,

16:09.677 --> 16:11.553
but I come bearing a message from him.

16:11.637 --> 16:13.722
It is impossible

16:14.181 --> 16:16.183
to get everyone out of the citadel safely.

16:16.266 --> 16:20.896
However, we will continue
to supply you with food using this method,

16:21.271 --> 16:23.565
so try to hold out here
for as long as you can.

16:27.903 --> 16:29.905
Chin up, everyone!

16:31.407 --> 16:34.159
BASE CAMP IN MUNGYEONG SAEJAE

16:42.918 --> 16:43.752
How is he doing?

16:45.004 --> 16:47.089
His body temperature keeps dropping.

16:49.216 --> 16:50.259
But...

16:50.968 --> 16:54.054
you are certain that my uncle
will not turn into a monster, correct?

16:54.138 --> 16:56.807
Not everyone who has been bitten
by the resurrected

16:57.016 --> 16:59.351
turns into a monster.

17:00.394 --> 17:03.439
Dan-i, who was bitten
by His Majesty in Hanyang,

17:03.522 --> 17:05.399
did not turn into a monster.

17:06.775 --> 17:10.404
But he did become bedridden
and die eventually.

17:12.239 --> 17:16.702
The symptoms changed
at Jiyulheon in Dongnae.

17:17.453 --> 17:20.539
Those who ate Dan-i's flesh
turned into monsters...

17:21.415 --> 17:24.168
and started spreading the disease.

17:24.251 --> 17:25.169
Then,

17:26.253 --> 17:28.464
what will become of my uncle?

17:29.798 --> 17:31.925
He won't be infected by the disease.

17:32.551 --> 17:34.553
But if we cannot find a way to treat him,

17:35.095 --> 17:38.140
he will eventually die as Dan-i did.

17:42.686 --> 17:44.772
Seo-bi, please save his life.

17:45.939 --> 17:49.276
I understand what my uncle did
to His Majesty cannot be forgiven,

17:50.277 --> 17:52.321
but we cannot let him die
such a horrible death.

17:52.404 --> 17:53.322
I had no choice...

17:54.281 --> 17:56.450
but to helplessly let Dan-i die.

17:58.744 --> 18:00.537
But this time, I will be sure to cure him.

18:02.623 --> 18:06.043
If I cure him and find out what is causing
such symptoms to manifest,

18:06.251 --> 18:09.630
I should be able to find a way to bring
the plague under control for good.

18:10.214 --> 18:13.467
All right. Whatever you do,
please save my uncle's life.

18:15.886 --> 18:17.846
His body is ice-cold.

18:18.180 --> 18:20.766
I will go fetch some herbs
that will warm him up.

18:20.849 --> 18:22.976
Sure, all right.

18:28.023 --> 18:29.608
Seo-bi, wait.

18:30.192 --> 18:31.068
Would this work?

18:31.151 --> 18:33.612
This is some rare medicine
that the Queen asked for.

18:34.905 --> 18:39.243
This is sappanwood,
used to treat gynecological conditions.

18:40.035 --> 18:42.579
We cannot treat Lord Cho with this.

18:47.876 --> 18:48.919
Wait.

18:50.796 --> 18:51.880
Did you say...

18:52.714 --> 18:55.425
Her Majesty asked for this?

18:57.386 --> 19:00.180
This isn't for Her Majesty herself,
correct?

19:00.264 --> 19:03.433
Why do you think I tried so hard
to get this if it were not for the Queen?

19:06.186 --> 19:08.272
You mean to say
that the Queen took this herself?

19:09.898 --> 19:11.733
That cannot be.

19:15.863 --> 19:18.282
Did Her Majesty take it recently?

19:19.700 --> 19:21.827
What difference does that make

19:21.910 --> 19:23.829
when my uncle is at death's door?

19:23.912 --> 19:25.414
Please, tell me.

19:27.666 --> 19:29.835
I had to get some last month
as well as the month before.

19:32.421 --> 19:33.672
What is wrong?

19:49.188 --> 19:50.189
Your Royal Highness.

19:51.356 --> 19:52.733
We have a problem.

19:57.487 --> 19:58.405
What happened?

19:58.822 --> 20:00.616
Where are the soldiers
who were on guard here?

20:00.908 --> 20:03.785
They were found dead behind the building.

20:03.869 --> 20:04.995
Who did this?

20:06.288 --> 20:07.706
Who did this, I ask you?

20:09.166 --> 20:11.293
I heard
that Your Royal Highness' personal guard

20:11.376 --> 20:13.295
passed the three gates with a carriage,

20:13.378 --> 20:15.589
saying it was your orders.

20:42.032 --> 20:43.492
What is this place?

20:45.786 --> 20:49.539
His Majesty collapsed a few days ago
due to smallpox,

20:50.040 --> 20:52.251
so the palace is in chaos now.

20:53.502 --> 20:56.421
I am the only one who can look after you,

20:56.755 --> 21:00.092
so I was worried about leaving you
all alone right before you are due.

21:01.009 --> 21:03.178
This is my close acquaintance's residence,

21:04.221 --> 21:06.181
so stay here for a few days.

21:06.765 --> 21:08.225
But if I am here,

21:08.892 --> 21:10.894
who will cook and make your bed

21:10.978 --> 21:13.772
when you come home
even for just a few hours?

21:14.523 --> 21:15.399
I would...

21:15.732 --> 21:18.443
like to stay beside you.

21:24.157 --> 21:27.369
I do not know what I did
to deserve such a loving wife

21:27.703 --> 21:31.999
when you have suffered much
due to your foolish husband.

21:36.753 --> 21:37.921
I apologize.

21:39.214 --> 21:40.716
I truly am sorry.

21:44.428 --> 21:45.971
I understand.

21:47.306 --> 21:49.433
Do not worry about me.

21:52.477 --> 21:54.062
It will only be for a few days.

21:54.980 --> 21:56.773
Stay here for just a few days

21:56.857 --> 21:58.191
and look after yourself.

22:13.915 --> 22:15.250
Show her into her bedroom.

22:15.834 --> 22:17.294
This way, please.

22:38.690 --> 22:39.691
You made a wise decision.

22:41.735 --> 22:44.654
I am truly glad
that you brought her here yourself.

22:46.031 --> 22:48.116
You are ensuring your wife's safety,

22:48.825 --> 22:51.078
and we are getting what we want.

22:54.331 --> 22:55.248
If...

22:56.291 --> 22:58.293
anything bad happens to my wife,

23:01.004 --> 23:02.214
I will never...

23:04.216 --> 23:05.926
I will never let it slide.

23:11.765 --> 23:14.434
Who do you think you are to threaten me?

23:17.479 --> 23:20.565
Shall I go grab your wife by her hair
and drag her here...

23:22.067 --> 23:23.985
so I can kill her before your eyes?

23:26.947 --> 23:30.075
I understand that the Crown Prince
is fond of you, but do you think

23:30.158 --> 23:33.412
that a mere guard can stand
against the Haewon Cho Clan?

23:35.205 --> 23:37.791
I need to know where the Crown Prince
goes and whom he meets.

23:37.958 --> 23:39.668
Report everything to me.

23:40.168 --> 23:41.420
That is the only way...

23:42.170 --> 23:43.505
to ensure your safety...

23:44.548 --> 23:46.007
and your family's as well.

23:46.591 --> 23:47.717
Do I make myself clear?

24:37.434 --> 24:39.769
It has already been four hours
since they left.

24:39.853 --> 24:42.439
They are carrying a patient,
but they must've gotten far by now.

24:42.522 --> 24:44.149
If Cho Hak-ju reaches Hanyang
before we do,

24:44.232 --> 24:46.276
he'll return
with the rest of the Five Armies.

24:46.359 --> 24:48.278
The people are still scarred by the war.

24:48.361 --> 24:49.905
We cannot let our country implode again.

24:49.988 --> 24:51.364
But how will you catch him?

24:51.448 --> 24:53.700
There are many routes
to get to Hanyang from here.

24:55.035 --> 24:56.203
I am a tiger hunter.

24:56.578 --> 24:58.622
I'm better at chasing a target
than anyone.

24:58.747 --> 25:00.040
Please allow me to accompany you.

25:18.517 --> 25:19.518
Is anyone outside?

25:19.601 --> 25:20.602
HANYANG CONFERENCE HALL

25:20.685 --> 25:22.354
Why have we not received word yet?

25:24.523 --> 25:27.484
We have not heard anything
from the Queen's Palace yet.

25:27.567 --> 25:30.570
But her labor pains began hours ago!

25:31.112 --> 25:33.281
Perhaps something has gone wrong?

25:33.365 --> 25:36.117
Stop making such a fuss and sit back down.

25:36.201 --> 25:38.036
You are distracting all of us.

25:42.541 --> 25:46.086
Are you all not curious, though?

25:47.087 --> 25:50.465
His Majesty was falling in and out
of consciousness due to the plague.

25:51.341 --> 25:55.762
So why did the Chief State Councillor
take His Majesty to Mungyeong Saejae?

25:56.638 --> 25:58.515
That is not important right now.

25:58.848 --> 26:02.644
This is about whether or not we can
restore the backbone of this kingdom.

26:21.871 --> 26:23.582
Who took the pregnant women
and the children?

26:25.375 --> 26:26.835
How dare you!

26:27.544 --> 26:30.380
You dare have the audacity
to suspect Her Majesty?

26:31.381 --> 26:34.968
If Her Majesty finds out about this,

26:35.885 --> 26:36.803
you will...

26:37.512 --> 26:40.473
face a brutal punishment at once!

26:43.184 --> 26:45.186
Are you keeping a close watch
on the Queen's Palace?

26:46.187 --> 26:47.230
Yes, sir.

26:47.439 --> 26:50.066
We are closely monitoring everyone
related to the Queen's Palace,

26:50.150 --> 26:52.944
from all the court ladies
to court maids and even water maids.

26:53.278 --> 26:54.154
Sir.

26:56.489 --> 27:00.660
I heard something strange from the people
who lent palanquins to Naeseonjae.

27:01.870 --> 27:06.499
It seems the people at Naeseonjae borrowed
six palanquins last night, not three.

27:17.719 --> 27:19.179
How can we help you?

27:20.430 --> 27:22.682
We must check something
in the servants' quarters urgently.

27:22.766 --> 27:25.268
We cannot let anyone in at the moment.

27:25.852 --> 27:28.688
Can't we even check
the servants' quarters?

27:29.481 --> 27:31.650
We are looking for evidence
of a serious crime.

27:33.193 --> 27:34.319
Step aside.

27:55.465 --> 27:56.758
What is this about?

27:59.219 --> 28:01.513
Her Majesty is about to give birth.

28:02.055 --> 28:04.474
How dare you cause a scene here?
This will not go unpunished.

28:04.557 --> 28:08.144
The guards at the East Gate
told us that they saw

28:08.353 --> 28:11.564
three palanquins entering the
Queen's Palace around 10 p.m. last night.

28:11.648 --> 28:13.942
A few wet nurses came

28:14.401 --> 28:15.819
to breastfeed the baby.

28:15.902 --> 28:18.071
Right. The guards said
they let the palanquins in

28:18.154 --> 28:20.573
without even asking who were inside
because you told them so.

28:20.657 --> 28:21.616
However,

28:22.867 --> 28:25.453
I must know who was in those palanquins.

28:25.912 --> 28:28.123
As I said, it was the wet nurses.

28:28.206 --> 28:29.332
Step aside.

28:52.647 --> 28:54.149
What on earth happened?

28:54.232 --> 28:58.695
We arrested him for entering the Office
of Royal Delivery at the Queen's Palace.

28:58.778 --> 29:03.199
You barged into the Queen's Palace,
knowing that Her Majesty is in labor?

29:03.283 --> 29:06.703
Did you not know that even the king
cannot enter the Office of Royal Delivery?

29:07.162 --> 29:10.123
I understand that you are the head
of the Royal Commandery Division,

29:10.206 --> 29:12.834
but you shall be punished
as this is a serious offense.

29:13.710 --> 29:15.670
The head of Royal Commandery
has been arrested,

29:16.171 --> 29:18.298
and all the soldiers
that were searching Naeseonjae...

29:19.507 --> 29:20.592
have left.

29:30.393 --> 29:32.187
How dare they try to investigate me?

29:32.854 --> 29:35.356
Those rats in Royal Commandery
have dug their own graves.

29:35.940 --> 29:39.944
No one can outsmart Your Majesty.

29:40.737 --> 29:42.781
The Royal Commandery Division
has lost its power,

29:43.114 --> 29:46.576
so there is no one
to get in Your Majesty's way now.

29:49.913 --> 29:50.830
What...

29:51.915 --> 29:52.957
about the baby?

29:53.041 --> 29:56.711
I have sent the rest of the pregnant women
back to Naeseonjae.

29:57.253 --> 29:58.087
I believe...

29:58.588 --> 30:01.758
we can expect good news soon.

30:10.600 --> 30:13.269
Sir! We need to stop for a few minutes.

30:17.273 --> 30:18.399
Sir!

30:18.817 --> 30:20.652
He seems to be in critical condition.

30:21.402 --> 30:22.403
Sir!

30:26.908 --> 30:28.618
His body is ice-cold,

30:28.701 --> 30:30.578
and I can barely feel his pulse.

30:32.539 --> 30:34.332
How much longer do you think
he will hold out?

30:34.749 --> 30:37.126
At this rate, he will die soon.

30:40.255 --> 30:43.007
We must find a place to lie him down.

31:02.235 --> 31:03.278
Wait...

31:03.361 --> 31:05.363
Wait, Seo-bi.

31:15.164 --> 31:16.165
Goodness.

32:13.556 --> 32:15.183
They went that way.

32:15.808 --> 32:17.352
It is the only route to Hanyang,

32:17.685 --> 32:19.812
so we should be able to catch them.

32:25.777 --> 32:27.236
Why did you not do anything?

32:30.406 --> 32:31.950
You knew, Your Royal Highness.

32:33.242 --> 32:34.869
You knew that he had betrayed you.

32:40.458 --> 32:42.752
I did not want to lose
yet another person from my life.

32:45.296 --> 32:46.506
That is why.

32:49.008 --> 32:50.510
I wanted to trust him.

33:06.150 --> 33:07.193
Sir.

33:08.194 --> 33:10.697
When will His Royal Highness arrive?

33:10.989 --> 33:12.782
You said he told you to leave first.

33:19.247 --> 33:20.540
How is Lord Cho?

33:21.040 --> 33:25.211
I managed to stabilize his condition,
but he does not seem to be doing too well.

33:26.087 --> 33:28.673
We should wait for His Royal Highness
here.

33:32.218 --> 33:33.761
No, we will leave now.

33:33.845 --> 33:34.679
Get ready.

33:35.638 --> 33:37.223
Did His Royal Highness...

33:38.141 --> 33:40.309
really say we should leave first?

33:43.646 --> 33:46.733
You never intended
to wait for him, did you?

33:47.358 --> 33:49.318
I do not know why you are acting this way,

33:51.821 --> 33:53.406
but you should not.

33:54.615 --> 33:58.244
His Royal Highness was very fond of you,
and has relied on you so much.

33:59.579 --> 34:02.999
And you were always by His Royal
Highness's side, keeping him safe.

34:06.753 --> 34:08.421
I told you to get ready.

34:09.005 --> 34:10.214
I will not.

34:10.548 --> 34:12.884
There is something
I must tell His Royal Highness.

34:16.554 --> 34:20.016
This is sappanwood, a type of
medicinal tree that only grows in Japan.

34:20.099 --> 34:23.478
It is very rare and expensive,
meaning it is difficult to procure.

34:24.062 --> 34:26.147
- What of it?
- Typically, it is used to...

34:26.939 --> 34:29.567
remove blood clots
after a miscarriage or birth

34:29.650 --> 34:33.321
or to alleviate symptoms that arise
from improper or lack of postpartum care.

34:33.654 --> 34:35.490
It is very potent,

34:36.032 --> 34:38.493
so it cannot be given to anyone
who is pregnant.

34:38.576 --> 34:40.787
What are you trying to say?

34:40.870 --> 34:42.121
I heard...

34:43.039 --> 34:45.083
that Her Majesty has been taking it.

34:45.917 --> 34:47.627
What are you saying?

34:48.294 --> 34:50.630
You just said that it cannot
be taken during pregnancy.

34:50.713 --> 34:52.590
The magistrate told me so.

34:52.673 --> 34:55.718
He said that Her Majesty takes this.

34:55.802 --> 34:57.428
He must be mistaken.

34:57.512 --> 34:59.013
I, too, cannot fathom what is going on.

34:59.097 --> 35:01.557
But if it is true,

35:02.850 --> 35:05.353
we must tell His Royal Highness.

35:05.686 --> 35:09.190
We must find out
why Her Majesty is taking it.

35:14.904 --> 35:16.280
- Wait.
- Yes?

35:16.364 --> 35:18.491
- Are you all done?
- Yes.

35:50.356 --> 35:51.607
Did you just say...

35:52.984 --> 35:55.444
it is normally taken
after a miscarriage or birth?

35:56.112 --> 35:57.321
Yes.

36:10.668 --> 36:12.211
Are you all right, my lord?

36:14.463 --> 36:16.048
Where are we?

36:17.466 --> 36:18.718
What is this?

36:19.260 --> 36:20.303
What is it...

36:20.970 --> 36:22.388
used for?

36:24.223 --> 36:25.808
What is that?

36:25.892 --> 36:28.769
At Naeseonjae, I saw pregnant women
who seemed to be due soon.

36:29.979 --> 36:31.314
Why were they gathered there?

36:33.441 --> 36:36.569
What are you plotting over there?

36:38.613 --> 36:40.072
Answer me.

37:16.734 --> 37:17.860
Escort Lord Cho!

37:17.944 --> 37:18.903
Yes, sir!

37:55.940 --> 37:56.941
Sir!

38:13.457 --> 38:14.792
Seo-bi,

38:15.001 --> 38:16.252
the thing is...

38:17.837 --> 38:20.673
my uncle told me to do this,
so I had no choice.

38:33.769 --> 38:34.854
Seo-bi, come with us.

38:35.771 --> 38:38.691
If you refuse, he will kill you as well.

38:41.694 --> 38:43.112
Go.

38:46.615 --> 38:47.700
Go...

38:51.412 --> 38:53.748
and find out, no matter what.

39:01.630 --> 39:02.965
Go.

39:06.260 --> 39:07.386
Hurry.

40:36.934 --> 40:39.228
Mu-yeong! Mu-yeong...

40:41.730 --> 40:43.023
Mu-yeong!

40:44.817 --> 40:45.776
Mu-yeong!

40:53.742 --> 40:54.785
Your Royal Highness.

40:57.246 --> 40:58.080
Your Royal Highness.

41:03.085 --> 41:04.503
Your Royal Highness.

41:05.921 --> 41:08.132
I am sorry, Your Royal Highness.

41:09.842 --> 41:11.677
I apologize...

41:13.387 --> 41:15.514
for my foolishness, Your Royal Highness.

41:19.560 --> 41:21.312
He is critically injured!

41:22.313 --> 41:24.273
Is there anything we can do?

41:31.697 --> 41:33.240
There were many pregnant women...

41:34.366 --> 41:36.785
gathered together at Naeseonjae.

41:37.286 --> 41:38.954
The Queen and her retinue...

41:39.622 --> 41:42.124
are surely scheming something.

41:43.167 --> 41:44.335
The female physician...

41:45.544 --> 41:48.214
The female physician knows,
Your Royal Highness.

41:51.383 --> 41:52.843
My wife...

41:55.554 --> 41:58.015
is also at Naeseonjae.

42:08.359 --> 42:09.693
My family...

42:11.946 --> 42:13.697
is there.

42:18.702 --> 42:20.454
It was because...

42:23.874 --> 42:25.459
I was foolish...

42:28.212 --> 42:30.965
that I failed
to protect you until the end.

42:33.133 --> 42:34.802
I am sorry, Your Royal Highness.

42:43.018 --> 42:44.144
Mu-yeong.

42:45.062 --> 42:49.024
Mu-yeong.

42:56.991 --> 43:00.703
Mu-yeong.

43:07.751 --> 43:11.505
Mu-yeong.

47:48.782 --> 47:51.159
Subtitle translation by Liya Choi
